### How to use?

1. Clone this repo to packages/apps/DolbyUI

2. To build add `device.mk` in device tree:

```
# LunarisDolby
PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
    LunarisDolby
```

example :- https://github.com/Spanish-or-Vanish/android_device_xiaomi_sm8350-common/commit/aed140439899dbe562cf407327e4ec8bc0b5a2a7

